  "usage_note": "**Daddy** is used mostly by young children and when speaking to them; some adults keep using it for their own father, especially in the southern United States. When it is used as a name, it begins with a capital letter: *Thanks, Daddy.* After **my**, **your**, and so on it does not: *her daddy*.",
